      "year": "specimen",
      "paper": "ESAT",
      "module": "biology",
      "question_number": 15,
      "question_text": "The diagram shows a kidney and its associated vessels from a healthy individual.\n\n \n\n        [not to scale]\n\n \n\nWhich row correctly identifies the vessels along with the concentration of urea they contain?",
      "question_images": [],
      "screenshot": "esat_screenshots/biology/q15.png",
      "explanation_screenshot": "",
      "options": {
