      "question_text": "Which of the statements about the genetic modification of a bacterium to produce human insulin are correct?\n\n \n\n   1. Human insulin DNA is cut out using an enzyme.\n\n \n\n   2. This DNA is inserted into the nucleus of a bacterium.\n\n \n\n   3. The modified bacterium is cultured.\n\n \n\n   4. The bacterial cells are injected into humans with diabetes.",
